collections\/i-love-salts-e-juice\"\u003eI Love Salt\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"Nic salts in Kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\"\u003enicotine salts in Kenya\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e collection with more than +150 salts option.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"I LOVE SALTS","offers":[{"title":"5.0% (50mg)","offer_id":41670484787255,"sku":"69d25e63bbbd3","price":999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"2.5% (25mg)","offer_id":41670484820023,"sku":"69d25e6335060","price":999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/I_love_Salts_Wild_Watermelon.jpg?v=1747700651"},{"product_id":"pacific-passion-i-love-salts","title":"Blue Strawberry by I Love Salts","description":"\u003cdiv data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eI Love Salts Blue Strawberry vape juice is an exquisite blend of fresh tropical fruits from the Pacific region that will have you feeling like you’re on a island beach with a cocktail made from silky coconut milk, freshly squeezed pineapple juice, and ripe strawberries.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eI love Salts Pacific Passion is a confluence of creamy coconut, strawberry and pineapple. Currents of flavor flow together smoothly and you will ride a wave of sweetness through exhale. Coconut gives this flavor added buoyancy this but does not stop the fruitiness from reaching flood tide. Sold in 30ml bottles, I Love Salts Pacific Passion is available in 2.5 and 5 percent nic strength.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlue Strawberry was formerly Pacific Passion by I Love Salts.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"I love salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/i-love-salts-e-juice\"\u003eI Love Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"Nic salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\"\u003enicotine liquid Kenya\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e collection with more than +150 salts option.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"I LOVE SALTS","offers":[{"title":"5.0% (50mg)","offer_id":41670484852791,"sku":"5","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"2.5% (25mg)","offer_id":41670484885559,"sku":"3","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blue-strawberry-i-love-salts.jpg?v=1747700655"},{"product_id":"blue-raspberry-i-love-salts","title":"Blue Raspberry By I Love Salts","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis sweet blueberry and raspberry nic salt juice blend is a perfect all day vape for nicotine salt lovers. Refill your favorite vape pod with this new nic salt from I Love Salts e Juice. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/i-love-salts-e-juice\" title=\"I love salts\"\u003eI Love Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"Nic salts\"\u003enic salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e collection with more than +150 salts option.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"I LOVE SALTS","offers":[{"title":"5.0% (50mg)","offer_id":41670484918327,"sku":"Blue Raspberry By I Love S - 50 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"2.5% (25mg)","offer_id":41670484951095,"sku":"Blue Raspberry By I Love S - 25 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ilovesalt_blueraspberry.jpg?v=1747700657"},{"product_id":"sweet-tobacco-i-love-salts","title":"Sweet Tobacco by I Love Salts","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSweet Cavendish tobacco naturally mimics the flavor of vanilla when barrel aged. The rough and earthy edge of tobacco has never been smoothed over so seamlessly. Sweet Tobacco I Love Salts manages to capture the essence of creamy Cavendish tobacco and the nic salt inhale is positively silken. If you are looking for a sophisticated tobacco nic salt, this is the flavor for you. I Love Salts are sold in 30ml bottles and come in 2.5 and 5.0 percent nic strength.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/i-love-salts-e-juice\" title=\"I love salts\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eI Love Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"nicotine liquid Kenya\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003enicotine liquid Kenya\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e collection with more than +150 salts option.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"I LOVE SALTS","offers":[{"title":"5.0% (50mg)","offer_id":41670484983863,"sku":"SWEET TOBACCO BY I LOVE SALTS 5","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"2.5% (25mg)","offer_id":41670485016631,"sku":"SWEET TOBACCO BY I LOVE SALTS 3","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ilovesalt_sweettobacco_1.jpg?v=1747700660"},{"product_id":"spearmint-gum-i-love-salts","title":"Spearmint Gum by I Love Salts","description":"\u003cdiv data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-mce-fragment=\"1\" class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFew things are as good of a wakeup call as an invigorating whiff of fresh spearmint. With I Love Salts Spearmint Gum, you can get an invigorating wave of minty fresh spearmint gum with every single vape. Made by Mad Hatter Vapes, this nicotine salt e-juice is infused with intensely mega-mint flavor from start to finish and leaves a refreshing taste in your mouth long after you exhale. On the side of the I Love Salts Spearmint Gum bottle, the vaping facts note that the flavor is 100% ice cold, 100% mouth-tingling spearmint, and 100% refreshing mint. If you’re a fan of menthol or mint flavors, this juice is a must-try.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your