c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"Nic salts\"\u003enic salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e collection with more than +150 salts option.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"I LOVE SALTS","offers":[{"title":"5.0% (50mg)","offer_id":41670485147703,"sku":"Blue Raspberry Ice by I Love S - 50 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"2.5% (25mg)","offer_id":41670485180471,"sku":"Blue Raspberry Ice by I Love S - 25 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ilovesalt_bluerapsberryice.jpg?v=1747700664"},{"product_id":"strawberry-ice-i-love-salts","title":"Strawberry Ice by I Love Salts","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe bold flavor of strawberry makes for a grand nic salt but it is even better when coated in a smooth menthol chill. An icy gust of menthol balances the exhale while the tartness of strawberry counteracts the sugary fruit flavors. The crispness of the mint draws out all of the complex elements in Strawberry Ice I Love Salts, which is sold in 30ml and has two nic strength options: 2.5 and 5 percent.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/ww