cotine salt e-juice flavor that’s hard to stop vaping. The intense fruit flavors in I Love Salts Grappleberry stay well-balanced throughout each inhale, allowing your tastebuds to savor the sweet essence of crisp apples, freshly picked grapes and ripe blueberries.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis Grappleberry E-Juice is part of Mad Hatter Vapes’ new I Love Salts line, which is made up of nicotine salt e-liquids infused with inventive flavors. You can get a bottle in 25 mg or 50 mg, depending on the nicotine strength you prefer. I Love Salts juices are best used with a vape pod system and should never be used with a sub-ohm system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet a grip on I Love Salts Grappleberry ASAP!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"I love salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/i-love-salts-e-juice\"\u003eI Love Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"Nic salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\"\u003enic salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e collection with more than +150 salts option.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"I LOVE SALTS","offers":[{"title":"5.0% (50mg)","offer_id":41670485311543,"sku":"Grappleberry by I Love S - 50 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"2.5% (25mg)","offer_id":41670485344311,"sku":"Grappleberry by I Love S - 25 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ilovesalt_grappleberry.jpg?v=1747700669"},{"product_id":"tropic-mango-i-love-salts","title":"Tropic Ma