"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNom. Nom. Nom. Wow. This juice is delicious. Oh, sorry for that minor interruption. That’s what happens when you vape I Heart Salts Fruity Cereal E-Juice. It kind of takes you to another place. A spectrum of sweet and fruity cereal flavors is swept in by the taste of pure whole milk and plenty of sugar as you inhale this nicotine salt juice. Each vape of I Heart Salts Fruit Cereal tastes like slurping an overfull spoonful of your favorite crunchy fruit cereal.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFruity Cereal is part of Mad Hatter Vapes’ I Love Salts juice line, which is made up strictly of nicotine salt e-liquids. This means you’ll get a more powerful nic hit when you inhale. The I Love Salts e-juices are available in either 25 mg or 50 mg nicotine strength, so you have control over your desired nicotine level. Like all nic salts, Fruit Cereal is not to be used with sub-ohm devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet the scoop on Fruity Cereal E-Juice by buying a bottle now!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"I love salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/i-love-salts-e-juice\"\u003eI Love Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"Nic salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\"\u003enic salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e collection with more than +150 salts option.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"I LOVE SALTS","offers":[{"title":"5.0% (50mg)","offer_id":41670485573687,"sku":"FRUITY CEREAL BY I LOVE SALTS 5","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"2.5% (25mg)","offer_id":41670485606455,"sku":"FRUITY CEREAL BY I LOVE SALTS 2.5","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ilovesalt_fruitcereal.jpg?v=1747700678"},{"product_id":"luau-lemonade-i-love-salts","title":"Luau Lemonade by I Love Salts","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCelebrate summer year-round and jetset to a faroff island with this delicious new nic salt flavor from I Love Salts. Luau Lemonade will send your tastebuds on a tropical getaway with its potent mix of lemonade, watermelon, and pineapple.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"I love salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/i-love-salts-e-juice\"\u003eI Love Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"Nic salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\"\u003enic salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e collection with more than +150 salts option.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"I LOVE SALTS","offers":[{"title":"5.0% (50mg)","offer_id":41670485639223,"sku":"LUAU LEMONADE BY I LOVE SALTS","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"2.5% (25mg)","offer_id":41670485671991,"sku":"LUAU LEMONADE BY I LOVE SALTS","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ilovesalt_luaulemonade.jpg?v=1747700681"},{"product_id":"juicy-apples-i-love-salts","title":"Juicy Apples by I Love Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003eJuicy Apples Nic Salt e-Liquid is a slice of fresh, invigorating sweetness that comes to you via I Love Salts, the newest juice like from Mad Hatter Vapes. This mouthwatering e-liquid is infused with pure apple goodness that’s as crisp and sweet as taking a big bite of an apple plucked right from the tree! As you inhale, you can taste the essence of sliced apple or apple juice, which heightens at the top of the inhale. The exhale leaves a pleasantly sweet aftertaste too.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJuicy Apples is available in 25 mg or 50 mg nicotine levels to give you that extra oomph you need sometimes. This juice is made with 50% VG and 50% PG, so balances flavor and vapor well, but still gives a noticeable throat hit. Like other nicotine salt vape liquids, Juicy Apples is only intended for use in pod systems.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDig into a bottle of Juicy Apples by I Love Salts today!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"I love salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/i-love-salts-e-juice\"\u003eI Love Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"e liquid online Kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\"\u003ee liquid online Kenya\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e collection with more than +150 salts option.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","brand":"I LOVE SALTS","offers":[{"title":"5.0% (50mg)","offer_id":41670485704759,"sku":"Juicy Apples by I Love S - 50 mg","price":999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"2.5% (25mg)","offer_id":41670485737527,"sku":"Juicy Apples by I Love S - 25 mg","price":999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ilovesalt_juicyapples.jpg?v=1747700683"},{"product_id":"strawberry-candy-i-love-salts","title":"Sweet Strawberry By I Love Salts","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eI Love Salts - Sweet Strawberry (Formerly Strawberry Candy) is part of the nic salt collection by Mad Hatter Juice, delivering a sweet-tooth fruity experience with vibrant strawberry notes in a perfect candy form for the ultimate treat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSince Strawberry Candy is a nic salt e-liquid, it’s only intended for use in pod systems. Like the other I Love Salts vape juices, Strawberry Candy is made with 50% VG and 50% PG and is available in 25 mg and 50 mg nicotine strengths.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSavor I Love Salts Strawberry Candy today!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ce